Z||000008||The Fieromaster||08-16-2001||12:54 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Oreif:<BR><B>OK I figured it out, If each member (calculated at 2900 members) would send me $6.00 I could buy the car! I would gladly give anyone who contributes a ride in it when I get it! Hell I'd let you "test Drive" it! What do you all say?<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  <P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>How bout 6 metaphorical $$ for 6 metaphorical test drives??  That help any?<P>If that was my car id keep it too!! TIGHT!<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_damon.gif">       <FONT COLOR="red">"Raced That, Wrecked Better"</FONT>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_damon.gif">    <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.askfelons.com/fieromaster/fieromastergif1.gif"">               <BR><B>~In Memory Of Jesse Cesek~ 1980-2000</B><BR><FONT COLOR="blue"><B>AIM: Fieromaster</B></FONT><BR><B><FONT COLOR="purple">1985 GT ~ Purple, Black and Yellow Interior(Fastback Converted)</FONT><BR><FONT COLOR="maroon">1997 Mitsu Eclipse GSX ~ Maroon w/ Hella Balls!(GSX = AWD, Turbo) DOA on 12/10/2000</FONT></B>||||reg||1
